--- /usr/pkgsrc/devel/reformatter-el/DESCR	1970-01-01 00:00:00.000000000 +0000
+++ devel/reformatter-el/DESCR	2026-10-03 01:00:58.000000000 +0000
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+reformatter.el lets you define an Emacs command which runs a
+reformatting program (such as zig fmt, black or prettier) on the
+current buffer or region, together with a minor mode that reformats
+on save.  Packages such as zig-mode use it to provide their
+format-on-save commands.
